<title>USA: Mackie Designs Q3 pro forma EPS $0.10.</title>
<headline>Mackie Designs Q3 pro forma EPS $0.10.</headline>
<dateline>WOODINVILLE, Wash. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>MACKIE DESIGNS INC.</p>
<p>				Income Statements</p>
<p>		  (In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				Three months ended  Nine months ended</p>
<p>					 September 30,    September 30,</p>
<p>					  1996    1995     1996    1995</p>
<p> Net sales			 $16,092 $16,897  $56,375 $47,251</p>
<p> Cost of sales		    10,114   9,860   34,619  27,087</p>
<p> Gross profit			5,978   7,037   21,756  20,164</p>
<p>Operating expenses:</p>
<p>  Marketing and sales	    2,103   2,289    7,074   6,839</p>
